<title>DENMARK: Phoenix says likely to bless Rieber bid.</title>
<headline>Phoenix says likely to bless Rieber bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish roadbuilder Phoenix Contractors said on Thursday that it would recommend to shareholders one of three suitors on Friday, probably Norway's Rieber and Son, the highest bidder.</p>
</text>
